---
---

<section class="newsletter" aria-label="メールマガジン登録">
  <div class="newsletter-inner">
    <p class="newsletter-eyebrow">NEWSLETTER</p>
    <h2 class="newsletter-title">戦略の知恵を、週に一度。</h2>
    <p class="newsletter-desc">
      新着記事・武将の名言・ビジネス応用コラムをまとめてお届けします。
    </p>

    <div class="substack-embed">
      <iframe
        src="https://ketsudankeifu.substack.com/embed"
        width="100%"
        height="200"
        style="border:none; background: transparent;"
        frameborder="0"
        scrolling="no"
        title="Substackメールマガジン登録"
      ></iframe>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .newsletter {
    background: var(--bg-navy);
    border-radius: 6px;
    margin: var(--sp-lg) 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    position: relative;
  }
  .newsletter::before {
    content: "策";
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 18rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: rgba(185, 28, 28, 0.05);
    position: absolute;
    right: -1rem;
    bottom: -2rem;
    line-height: 1;
    pointer-events: none;
    user-select: none;
  }
  .newsletter-inner {
    padding: var(--sp-lg);
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    max-width: 560px;
  }
  .newsletter-eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.25em;
    color: var(--amber, #d4a017);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }
  .newsletter-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #fff;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .newsletter-desc {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .substack-embed {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }
</style>
